{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tales of Wind Online</strong> is a 3D fantasy MMORPG that features fast-paced, action-driven combat from a top-down perspective. With a non-targeting battle system, players can move freely, dodge precisely, and unleash fluid combos with full control. The top-down view enhances battlefield awareness, making it easier to coordinate with teammates during epic boss fights for a more strategic and immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautifully rendered world built with 4K-quality standards. From sweeping terrain elevations to shimmering water effects and dynamic lighting, every corner of the map is crafted in full 3D to deliver a rich, cinematic visual journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The<strong>\u00a0version</strong> of <i>Tales of Wind Online</i> introduces a massive content overhaul and system upgrade optimized for PC. Key features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mobile System Integration</strong><br>Popular systems from the mobile version have been redesigned for PC, offering smoother gameplay and intuitive controls. More integrated features will be unveiled in future updates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Playable Class</strong><br>A brand-new class joins the battlefield, offering a fresh combat style and unique skill system that adds tactical depth and new team strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Major IP Collaboration</strong><br>An exciting crossover with a renowned IP is in the works\u2014one of the largest collaborations in X-Legend Games history. Whether you're a returning veteran or a new adventurer, thrilling surprises await.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to embark on a visually stunning, action-packed fantasy adventure!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902400?t=1757583858","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.stea