p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Playable Class</strong><br>A brand-new class joins the battlefield, offering a fresh combat style and unique skill system that adds tactical depth and new team strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Major IP Collaboration</strong><br>An exciting crossover with a renowned IP is in the works\u2014one of the largest collaborations in X-Legend Games history. Whether you're a returning veteran or a new adventurer, thrilling surprises await.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to embark on a visually stunning, action-packed fantasy adventure!</p>","developers":["X-Legend Entertainment Co., Ltd."],"ext_user_account_notice":"Google Account, LINE, X-Legend Account ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902400/618350f5775b053189f2d361c90dd314e2ee6d73/header.jpg?t=1757583858","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257174834,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174834/movie480.mp4?t=1755743519","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174834/movie_max.mp4?t=1755743519"},"name":"\u5ba3\u50b3\u7bc7EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257174834/5d491347cbd58b7b83908fb2e58145ee1981a564/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755743519","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174834/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755743519","max":"http://